  "_doc": "The provisional LOOK of a technique the engraving registry (container.json engraving.layout.devices.byTechnique) does not name — 2a's page, so that every note shows its written pitch in its clef: the notehead unit (head, accidental, ledgers, ottava) just before the attack, the parachute brick carrying the duration; a filled head for a one-shot, an open head for a sustained note; the notate text above the head. NO go line, no GC, no dynamics — those are his to assign, per technique. A byTechnique entry wins where one exists (the tuba vocabulary: ord, staccato, fortepiano, cuivre).",
